  "scope": [
    "Original name-slot search with -2 append, forward duplicate search, physical child movement, stable identity, assigned Android row id, unknown-type name-only slots, and independent truncation.",
    "Retained physical child keeps its captured original definition/type/style/action/options/cycle/caption/captured Map identity; new raw rows remain separate and new controls alone initialize defaults/evaluate Rhino labels.",
    "Same existing source actor, bounded request, original JVM/Rhino environment and task effects/events. reLoginView(true) is admitted as a typed ordered event and consumed by the actual existing View through reuseState.",
    "Physical callback binding follows current layout names/new raw type and first assigned physical child, while select/text/toggle listeners preserve old captured name/action/options; null reset revokes all physical Map identities.",
    "Actual getLoginData synthesizes raw text/password through physical EditText identity; incompatible binding is typed UI_BINDING_ERROR. Action inputBindingFailed is explicit unavailable input: original nil action/getLoginJs skip first; nonempty prelude rejects before any authored eval or source mutation.",
    "Existing owned FIFO and600ms per-control debounce use stable control identity; true does not rotate watcher generation; removed pending watchers retain their original action until debounce/dismiss lifecycle. No new store/cache/credential owner.",
    "Existing App regression method extended without new definition; one new Package method and one actual-product Native/JNI definition added for future fresh SDK execution."
  ],
